# read-only messages on a missing object: whole message ENOENT before execution (client-ops 5.4 #24)
read 0 10
---
stat
---
sparse-read 0 10
---
getxattr k
---
getxattrs
---
omap-get-vals
---
omap-get-keys
---
omap-get-header
---
omap-get-vals-by-keys a b
---
checksum crc32c 0 4 4
---
list-watchers
---
# cmpext in a read-only message on a missing object
cmpext 0 abc
---
# compound: first op decides, later ops not executed (rval 0)
stat; read 0 10
---
# FAILOK does not rescue the pre-execution ENOENT guard
read 0 10 !failok
---
# ... but a mutating op in the message disables the guard (touch + reads in committed view)
create; stat
